  "Seed for the Division Rivals rewards (owner design 2026-10-03, todo.md section 2). The server keeps them in the rivals_reward_options,",
  "rivals_promotion_rewards, rewards and reward_lines tables: a fresh database is filled from this file at start-up; an upgraded one converts the",
  "divisions and promotion its rules held. From then on they change through the operator panel (Modes, Rivals) and content changesets, not this file.",
  "divisions: for each division 1-10, its six ranks (Rank I first), each a list of 1-4 reward options the club chooses from (FIFA shows at most four);",
  "with several options they are granted from rivals_option_a, _b and _c (third and later), a single one from rivals_fixed. promotion: the reward",
  "for reaching each division the first time (rivals_promotion). A reward is coins, FUT Champions Points, XP (not paid by Rivals) and lines: a pack",
  "with a count and its own untradeable choice, which is what the club receives, and optionally the grant source it is recorded under.",
  "Values: the phase-1 table (pack-odds-2026-09 PLAN.md 5.1); each line's untradeable is what rules/tradeability.json paid before the tables."
